From ef9525c2c65b530767b325063fec14ca4103acc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: engine_harness_unreal <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 06:18:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] Ship the Engine Harness payload and its harness-mcp
 launcher

The build copies the harness payload (one bundled JavaScript file, the DCC
scripts and the recipes) into src/harness, which packaging ships as
resources/harness. At startup the app writes a harness-mcp launcher beside
the Windows shims (it reuses the bundled npx.cmd's Node.js: the portable
copy, a system Node.js 22+, or a download), or into userData/bin elsewhere,
and puts it on PATH with the recipes on GOOSE_RECIPE_PATH. The RunAsNode
fuse stays off.
