+# Engine Harness payload
+
+The build copies the harness payload here (`node scripts/bundle.mjs` in engine_harness_unreal, then `dist/payload/*`):
+`harness-mcp.mjs`, `dcc/`, `recipes/`, `NOTICE.md`. Packaging ships this folder as `resources/harness`, and
